From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Victor Momplet <mompletvictor@gmail.com>
Date: Tue, 20 Oct 2026 19:09:09 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] fix(workouts): the day's workout count counts each activity
 once

The cycle engine counted workouts by exact (start, end, sport), so the same session from
the strap and from Samsung a minute apart was two workouts (the coach's '2 workouts',
Trends, Coupled), and a dismissed detected bout still counted. It now counts the
Workouts list's own set: dismissed bouts out, then WorkoutEditing.dedupCrossSource.
Calories were never doubled (the day model already collapses the pair).

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
